Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:15.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Hey everybody! This is\NJordan Last, also known
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.48,0:00:19.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}as lastmjs. Hey, this is the first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:23.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}episode of the Millillion\Npodcast, and let me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:26.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}just give you a\Nquick background on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:28.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}what Millillion is.\NI'll give you a quick
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:31.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}background on myself,\Nin case you want to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:33.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}know that. I think\Nit'll be helpful. I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:36.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}a software developer.\NI have been a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:44.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}software developer for a while. I started\Nmy undergraduate education in 2009. I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.56,0:00:53.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}graduated in 2017 with a bachelor's\Ndegree in computer science. I love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.32,0:01:01.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}software. I love technology. It fascinates\Nme. The latent power of all these
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:06.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}technologies that we've been inventing\Nand being inspired to invent are just
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.84,0:01:10.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}absolutely fantastic to me. They're\Nbeautiful. They're amazing. I believe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.48,0:01:17.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}technology is one of the key things,\Nreasons, factors that brings prosperity
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:22.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to the world, and that helps to end\Nphysical human suffering. It's not
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.36,0:01:29.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}without its weaknesses, but I think it's\Ntechnology has been an absolute boon to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:35.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}mankind. Generally speaking, it's much\Nbetter than the benefits outweigh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:43.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}the costs, in my opinion. I've been\Nprofessionally developing to a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.32,0:01:48.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}certain extent, probably\Nsince 2013, I would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:54.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I've had a good go at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.52,0:01:56.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I think. I mean, it's\Nnot still a little
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:01:59.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}bit early in my career,\NI would say, but
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.32,0:02:09.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I've had an okay amount of experience.\NRight now, I call myself an agentic
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.24,0:02:15.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}engineer with an emphasis in software\Ndevelopment. Before, I definitely called
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.52,0:02:19.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}myself a software developer or a software\Nengineer. Now, though, I believe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.76,0:02:22.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}personally that anyone\Nin STEM fields or maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:25.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}even anyone in any field, we are
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:34.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}all agentic engineers now or agentic\Ndevelopers. We are using AI agents
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:40.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}to solve problems now. That's what\Nwe're doing. We're coordinating agents,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:48.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}we're managing agents, we're judging the\Noutputs of agents, and an agent, in case
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.16,0:02:52.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}you don't know, an\Nagent is an instance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:57.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}of an AI, an artificial\Nintelligence, that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:03:02.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}can actually go out and perform work for\Nyou somewhat autonomously, sometimes very
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.76,0:03:09.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}very very autonomously. This is kind\Nof the evolution of the chatbot. A
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:15.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}lot of people, I mean since 2022-ish,\NAI chatbots have been pretty popular
